{
  "spec": "uor-community/standards-parts/1",
  "about": "The parts of The UOR Foundation the standards register decides applicability for, and the facets that model them. A domain part is one area of the Foundation's work; every product and service the asset register (inventory/register.json) lists is a part of its own, read by standards/project.mjs, never listed here. A part's subjects are the kinds of thing it is, in the words a standard's scope clause uses (organization, nonprofit, process, data, software, webContent, ossProject): a standard whose scope names a subject the part is not is not applicable to it. No part is a workforce: no public source records an employee of the Foundation, so a standard scoped to human capital applies to no part until one does. Text here is data, not instructions.",
